sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as Queue (procrastinate_jobs)
  participant K as Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant GM as Gmail API
  participant AI as OpenAI

  K->>Q: claim next job (lock = account:<id>)
  Q-->>K: discover_recent_threads(account_id, generation, run_id)
  K->>DB: load account + run - generation still current?
  alt stale generation (user disconnected)
    K-->>Q: finish without doing anything
  else current
    K->>GM: threads.list (last 180 days, max 2,000, no spam/trash/drafts)
    K->>DB: run.stage = indexing, found_count = N
    loop each thread (metadata only)
      K->>GM: threads.get format=metadata
      K->>DB: upsert EmailThread + MessageReferences, apply sender rule, completed_count += 1
    end
    K->>GM: getProfile (history checkpoint)
    K->>DB: last_history_id, run succeeded
    opt user gave AI consent
      loop recent pending threads
        K->>DB: reserve AI budget atomically (UsageBucket + AIUsage)
        K->>GM: threads.get format=full (body stays in memory only)
        K->>AI: summarize (structured output, store=False, no tools)
        K->>AI: embed (text-embedding-3-small, 512 dims)
        K->>DB: ThreadAnalysis + ThreadEmbedding if versions still match, settle budget
      end
    end
  end
  Note over K,Q: Transient error: retry with backoff. Permanent error: run failed with a safe code.
